{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<h1>The Founder's Errata <span lang="ko" class="bi">/ 창업자 정오표</span></h1>

<p>An <em>errata</em> is a formal notice of correction attached to a previously published work, so that the original and the correction are read together. This repository applies the convention to the judgments of a single founder, Dr. Jee Hoon Ju, concerning AetherHeal Co., Ltd. and adjacent work. Each entry records a specific reversal — a position once held, a position now held, and the cause of the change — and accumulates as an append-only public record over time.</p>

{% if collections.entries and collections.entries.length %}
<ol class="entries" reversed>
  {% for entry in collections.entries | reverse %}
  <li>
    <span class="id">#{{ entry.data.id | padId }}</span>
    <time datetime="{{ entry.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ entry.data.date | isoDate }}</time>
    <a href="{{ entry.url | url }}">{{ entry.data.pageTitle }}</a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
{% else %}
<p><em>No entries yet.</em></p>
{% endif %}

<p class="back"><a href="https://jeehoonju.com/">&larr; jeehoonju.com</a></p>
{% endblock %}
